WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.655 --> 00:00:03.785
When you're a kid

00:00:04.880 --> 00:00:06.740
You think the universe revolves around you

00:00:09.320 --> 00:00:12.760
You think that you'll always be
protected and cared for

00:00:14.160 --> 00:00:14.900
Then

00:00:15.240 --> 00:00:16.180
one day

00:00:17.040 --> 00:00:18.700
you realize that's not true

00:00:24.960 --> 00:00:26.740
Because when you're alone as a kid

00:00:28.780 --> 00:00:30.520
the monsters see you as weaker

00:00:32.260 --> 00:00:34.460
you don't even know they're getting closer

00:00:36.320 --> 00:00:37.320
Nooo!!!

00:00:38.400 --> 00:00:39.940
Until it's too late

00:00:44.820 --> 00:00:45.820
Here

00:00:46.500 --> 00:00:47.780
take it

00:00:55.080 --> 00:00:57.080
My grandfather thinks this town is cursed

00:00:58.360 --> 00:01:01.760
That all the bad things that happen in this town
are because of one thing

00:01:03.760 --> 00:01:04.860
An evil thing

00:01:18.860 --> 00:01:21.560
Bill, if you will come with me

00:01:21.740 --> 00:01:23.040
you'll float, too.

00:01:23.240 --> 00:01:24.100
Georgie?

00:01:26.160 --> 00:01:27.360
I saw something

00:01:27.680 --> 00:01:28.440
A clown

00:01:29.100 --> 00:01:30.240
Yeah, I saw him too

00:01:32.480 --> 00:01:33.440
You'll float too

00:01:33.560 --> 00:01:36.380
What happens
when another Georgie goes missing?

00:01:38.800 --> 00:01:40.240
Or one of us?

00:01:40.380 --> 00:01:41.860
You'll float too

00:01:42.920 --> 00:01:44.460
Are you just gonna pretend it isn't happening

00:01:44.460 --> 00:01:45.680
like everyone else in this town?

00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:47.640
You'll float too!

00:01:48.340 --> 00:01:49.360
If we stick together

00:01:53.140 --> 00:01:53.920
We win

00:01:55.400 --> 00:01:56.900
You'll float too!

00:01:57.140 --> 00:01:58.840
You'll float too!

00:01:59.120 --> 00:02:00.800
You'll float too!

00:02:04.320 --> 00:02:05.960
[doll laughs]

